00:04:33.483 --> 00:04:37.204
<v Host>It means warning. It is higher than the advisory.

00:04:37.803 --> 00:04:47.644
<v Slow>全国の937の学校などで、学校やクラスが休みになっています。

00:04:48.444 --> 00:04:55.115
<v Host>At nine hundred thirty-seven schools across Japan, whole schools or classes are closed.

00:04:55.716 --> 00:04:57.923
<v Vocab>休み

00:04:58.324 --> 00:05:01.444
<v Host>It means a day off. Here, closed.

00:05:02.043 --> 00:05:11.620
<v Slow>厚生労働省は、マスクをつけることや、手を洗うことなどを呼びかけています。

00:05:12.420 --> 00:05:17.172
<v Host>The ministry is asking people to wear masks and wash their hands.

00:05:17.771 --> 00:05:19.980
<v Vocab>洗う

00:05:20.379 --> 00:05:22.252
<v Host>It means to wash.

00:05:22.851 --> 00:05:26.403
<v Host>Now let's listen to the whole story one more time.

00:05:27.004 --> 00:05:29.956
<v News>今日のニュースです。

