00:07:40.036 --> 00:07:46.108
<v Slow>厚生労働省は、何を呼びかけていますか。

00:07:46.908 --> 00:07:49.764
<v Host>Wearing masks and washing hands.

00:07:50.363 --> 00:07:57.180
<v Host>That's all for this morning. Wash your hands, take care, and thanks for listening. See you next time.

00:07:57.779 --> 00:08:00.180
